  status: missing
  note: |
    Searched index-core/src and the repo for FeedOptionsIntentStore, FeedOptionsIntent and
    feedOptionsIntents: nothing. Only ConvergenceKeyIntentStore exists, and IndexEngine has no
    takeFeedOptionsIntents / clearFeedOptionsIntents pass-throughs.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.1: The one existing intent kind has its own table, migration set and store, but there is no IndexerIntent union.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/convergence-key-intent-store.ts#ConvergenceKeyIntentStore, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/migrations/convergence-key-intents/index.ts#MIGRATIONS_TABLE]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/indexes/entity-meta-index.test.ts]
  note: |
    Done: convergence-key intents have the convergenceKeyIntents table, their own migration set
    (convergence_key_intent_migrations) and a record / take / clear store. Not done: no
    IndexerIntent tagged union with a `kind` discriminator is declared or exported from
    @dxos/index-core; the intent shape is an inline `{ spaceId, convergenceKey }` type.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.2: IndexEngine records convergence-key intents in the transaction that writes the batch's index rows.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#IndexEngine, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#convergenceKeyIntents, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/convergence-key-intent-store.ts#ConvergenceKeyIntentStore.record]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-client-e2e/src/convergence.test.ts]
  walkthrough:
    - The engine derives one intent per (space, key) from the slice being written. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#convergenceKeyIntents
    - The write transaction records them beside the entity-meta and index rows and the cursors. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#IndexEngine
    - The store inserts one row per intent on the caller's transaction connection. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/convergence-key-intent-store.ts#ConvergenceKeyIntentStore.record
  note: |
    Judged for the only intent kind that exists. The transactional atomicity itself is not asserted
    by a test; the e2e convergence tests exercise recording through indexing.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.3: take() returns the pending intents with the highest id read, and clear(…, upToId) keeps later rows.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/convergence-key-intent-store.ts#ConvergenceKeyIntentStore.take, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/convergence-key-intent-store.ts#ConvergenceKeyIntentStore.clear]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/indexes/entity-meta-index.test.ts]
  note: |
    For convergence-key intents take() returns them deduplicated per space as a
    Map<SpaceId, Set<string>>, and clear is per (spaceId, convergenceKey) bounded by upToId.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.4: Unserviced convergence-key intents stay pending and the startup pass offers them again.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/echo-host.ts#EchoHost._runIndexPass, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/convergence-key-merge.ts#ConvergenceKeyMerger.mergeDuplicates, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/index-scheduler.ts#IndexScheduler]
  walkthrough:
    - The merger reports a throwing group as un-serviced instead of failing the batch. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/convergence-key-merge.ts#ConvergenceKeyMerger.mergeDuplicates
    - The index pass clears only the keys the merger reports serviced, so the rest stay in the table. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/echo-host.ts#EchoHost._runIndexPass
    - The scheduler runs a pass on open, which takes the pending intents again. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/index-scheduler.ts#IndexScheduler
  note: |
    The code does it for convergence-key intents on the device. No test stops a host before clear
    and checks that the next pass re-offers the intent; convergence-key-merge.test.ts only checks
    that a throwing group is reported un-serviced. EDGE has no intent consumer at all.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.5: Keyed objects record a convergence-key intent and EchoHost's ConvergenceKeyMerger services it after the Automerge leg.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#convergenceKeyIntents, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#IndexEngine.takeConvergenceKeyIntents, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/echo-host.ts#EchoHost._runIndexPass, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/convergence-key-merge.ts#ConvergenceKeyMerger]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-client-e2e/src/convergence.test.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/convergence-key-merge.test.ts]
  walkthrough:
    - The engine reads a non-empty @meta.convergenceKey off each indexed object and records an intent. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#convergenceKeyIntents
    - The engine exposes the store's take to the host. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#IndexEngine.takeConvergenceKeyIntents
    - After the Automerge leg, the index pass takes the intents, merges and clears the serviced keys. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/echo-host.ts#EchoHost._runIndexPass
    - The merger looks each key's group up and merges duplicates. github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/convergence-key-merge.ts#ConvergenceKeyMerger
```

