```mdl
verdict F-3.1: Neither FeedDataSource skips blocks of a feed with indexing disabled.
  status: missing
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-host/src/db-host/feed-data-source.ts#FeedDataSource, github:dxos/edge/packages/services/db-service/src/worker/indexer/feed-data-source.ts#FeedDataSource]
  note: |
    Neither the device nor the EDGE FeedDataSource reads stored feed options; feeds carry no
    indexing option in the feed store. (EDGE skips trace-namespace feeds by not notifying the
    indexer, which is a namespace rule, not a per-feed option.)
```

