```mdl
verdict F-3.6: FeedSpace always notifies the Indexer DO of data-feed appends, but there is no disabled state whose index write it could skip.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/edge/packages/services/db-service/src/worker/feed-space/feed-space.ts#FeedSpace._notifyFeedItemsInserted, github:dxos/edge/packages/services/db-service/src/worker/indexer/indexer.ts#Indexer.onFeedItemsChanged]
  walkthrough:
