    - The Indexer indexes the feed items, which is what makes query triggers fire. github:dxos/edge/packages/services/db-service/src/worker/indexer/indexer.ts#Indexer.onFeedItemsChanged
  note: |
    Done: the notification is unconditional for data feeds. Not done: no per-feed indexing flag,
