```mdl
verdict F-4.1: Retention deletes blocks but leaves their index rows behind.
  status: missing
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/feed/src/feed-store.ts#FeedStore.deleteOldestBlocks, github:dxos/edge/packages/services/db-service/src/worker/feed-space/feed-space.ts#FeedSpace._trimFeedIfNeeded]
  note: |
    EDGE's FeedSpace trims a feed to maxQueueSize with FeedStore.deleteOldestBlocks; nothing tells
    the Indexer or removes the deleted items' objectSnapshot / fts / entity-meta rows, so queries
    can still return trimmed items (as D-7 states). The device has no retention at all.
```

